   "value": {
    "text": "For your next two days in Barcelona, expect a rainy first day with a high around 21°C, followed by a sunny second day with a high around 22°C. Pack a light, packable waterproof jacket or compact umbrella for the wet weather, along with water-resistant walking shoes that are comfortable enough to wear both days. Because temperatures will be mild, bring breathable layers such as T-shirts plus a light sweater or cardigan you can add or remove as needed. For the sunny second day, include sunglasses, sunscreen, and a hat. A small daypack will make it easy to carry your extra layers and rain gear as conditions change.\n\nNote that this is based on the researcher's findings, so check a live forecast before you leave in case conditions shift."
